+id: task-005-add-json-patch-creation
+type: task
+title: "Add JSON Patch creation"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Work completed
+
+Added `createPatch(from, to)`, which validates both JSON inputs and produces RFC 6902 `add`,
+`remove`, and `replace` operations that transform the former document into the latter without
+mutating either input. Object changes recurse by member; arrays use a deterministic edit sequence
+so insertions and removals do not replace an entire array. Added API documentation and tests for
+nested changes, escaped pointer tokens, no-op patches, root replacement, and array edits.
+
+## Verification
+
+`npm test`
